before:
Complete local Rust example; the app itself does not execute it:
```rust
struct Counter { n: u32 }
impl Counter {
    fn inc(&mut self) { self.n += 1; }
    fn read(&self) -> u32 { self.n }
}
fn main() {
    let mut counter = Counter { n: 4 };
    counter.inc();
    println!("{}", counter.read());
}
```

